462 0 obj
<< /BS << /W 0 >> /F 4 /FT /Btn /Ff 65536 /MK << /BC [ 0 0 0 0 ] >> /P 233 0 R /Rect [ 56.697006 485.648959 538.617004 746.048953 ] /Subtype /Widget /T (Figure1) /TU (Diagram illustrating the interaction between users and the Dimensions webapp instance via API endpoints. Users authenticate through `/api/auth.json`, receiving a token. They access various API endpoints for data services, including current and new versions `/api/dsl/v1` and `/api/dsl/v2`. The API instance handles authentication, throttling, and processes JSON queries. API V1 interfaces with services like Solr, Term Extraction, and others through a firewall, while API V2 logs data to Google Cloud services including BigQuery, Logging, and Data Studio.) /Type /Annot >>
endobj
